  "body": "In current version of the spec, ReadableStreamDefaultControllerGetDesiredSize and ReadableByteStreamControllerGetDesiredSize describe exactly the same process (this is because queueTotalSize is now used for both controllers). Wouldn't it be possible to define a single ReadableStreamControllerGenericGetDesiredSize, similarly to what is done for some reader operations?",
